        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The labor/management team will determine the mechanics of the bidding process. The parties agree to review the mechanics and make necessary changes after each bid. Any agreed changes to the mechanics of the bidding process will be provided to staff no later than thirty (30) days prior to the bid.",
